# {{ agents.store_name }}

> {{ agents.store_name }} is an Israeli online marketplace for specialty coffee: single-origin beans, blends, and curated tasting bundles from small, local roasteries that roast to order and ship fresh, direct to the customer.

We work with a curated set of independent Israeli roasteries — including Blooms, Brew Brothers, Canopy, EEZA, Coffee Org, Tostato, URU, and You Need Coffee — each of which roasts and ships its own products directly. An order spanning multiple roasteries may arrive as separate shipments, each with its own delivery timeline and free-shipping threshold. We ship within Israel only (no international shipping). Currency: {{ agents.currency }}. Primary interface language is Hebrew; an English version is available.

