## Ordering, shipping & delivery

- We ship within Israel only; we do not ship internationally.
- Delivery is typically 1-7 business days, and up to 9 business days for outlying areas (e.g. the Arava, southern Negev, Dead Sea region, Golan Heights).
- A standard delivery fee applies per shipment; free shipping is available above a minimum order amount that varies by roastery. Because each roastery ships separately, combining a full order with one roastery is the best way to qualify for free shipping.
- Accepted payment methods include Visa, Mastercard, Apple Pay, and Google Pay.
- Currency: NIS.

## Returns & support

Because coffee is a fresh, perishable food product, we do not accept returns on coffee. If an order arrives damaged, incorrect, or with a genuine quality issue, contact support with your order number and photos and we'll resolve it.
- Support email: hi@theorigin.co.il
- Phone / WhatsApp: 054-563-1523
- Contact form: {{ agents.store_url }}/pages/contact

