## Rules for agents

- Use live price and stock from the product page or the MCP endpoint — figures here or elsewhere may be out of date, and prices may change with promotions.
- Confirm with the human shopper before completing any purchase, checkout, or payment action on their behalf.
- Represent this store only using what's published on these pages and policies; don't invent claims, discounts, or availability that aren't stated here.
- Each roastery sets its own shipping timeline and free-shipping minimum — don't assume one flat rate applies store-wide.
- For order status, damaged items, or anything beyond a straightforward product question, direct the shopper to Contact rather than resolving it yourself.